  "caveats": [
    "median_decision_latency_s = median over episodes of (episode decision latency / episode selector calls); per-call latencies are not stored in the rows.",
    "Jev cost = input tokens x assumed US$0.042/Mtok (the API returns no cost field); other arms use list prices.",
    "cost_per_success and time_per_success keep failures in the numerator (total over all episodes / successes).",
    "recovery_success_rate = final success on forced_trap episodes of the eight recoverable families (irreversible is the negative control and excluded); recovery_success_among_deviations is also given.",
    "Auxiliary cost/time columns appear only when rows carry aux fields (v3b)."
  ],
